WEBVTT

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:09.468
It's been a long time, Chi You...

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:13.138
No, Thousand Changes Sydonay.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:17.059
To defeat our powerful forces...
You've done well.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:21.981
It will hurt, losing one of the few
who still call me by that old name.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:24.650
The Pennant of Offering, Di Hong.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.027
Annihilator of Bladed
Flowers, Yu Xuan.

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:30.739
Fear not. It will be Ball Masque
who will lament this loss,

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:35.035
while sorrow and torment
befall the other two of the Trinity.

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.662
Let's go, Di Hong!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.289
Indeed!

00:00:48.299 --> 00:00:52.344
Yu Xuan, feel fortunate.

00:00:52.553 --> 00:00:55.681
For today, you will see the
Divine Metal at Will's full power!

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.473
Will I?

00:00:56.682 --> 00:01:00.894
Then Chi You, I shall reciprocate
with my Sacrificial Sword-Awakening!

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.521
<i>Go'.!</i>

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:15.242
A beautiful technique.

00:01:15.451 --> 00:01:17.745
But it will neither move
my heart nor take my life.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:18.996
Impossible!

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.164
He's unhurt?

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:23.542
The Trinity's Treasures
differ from those of others.

00:01:23.751 --> 00:01:27.921
Divine Metal At Will neither
breaks nor bends, unless I will it so.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.382
And should I will it...

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:37.264
A trap?!

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:08.712
The beautiful die young,
like a flower whose petals fall.

00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:10.923
They entrance us.

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:19.515
Splendid work, General.

00:02:19.723 --> 00:02:23.060
The Shanghai Outlaw
headquarters has been obliterated.

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:28.982
Our leader will be
happy to hear of this victory.

00:02:29.191 --> 00:02:31.652
I don't know about that.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:35.948
We destroyed Shanghai, one of the
more independent enemy outposts.

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.700
The other leaders will now
unite under Europe's banner,

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:42.788
under Sophie Sawallisch.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:45.707
It is not a cause for joy.

00:03:05.436 --> 00:03:09.064
<i>Now set free</i>

00:03:09.273 --> 00:03:15.446
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:03:15.654 --> 00:03:19.324
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:25.372
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:03:25.581 --> 00:03:27.916
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:30.544
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:33.088
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:03:33.297 --> 00:03:37.968
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:03:38.177 --> 00:03:40.512
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:03:40.721 --> 00:03:43.182
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.809
<i>Your existence</i>

00:03:46.018 --> 00:03:50.898
<i>Cry out</i>

00:03:51.106 --> 00:03:53.317
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:56.069
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:56.278 --> 00:03:58.655
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:03:58.864 --> 00:04:06.788
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:04:06.997 --> 00:04:13.378
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.385
I'm back.

00:04:23.013 --> 00:04:23.472
What's this?

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.099
It's from the Braider of
Trembling Might, indeed.

00:04:26.308 --> 00:04:28.101
Sophie Sawallisch.

00:04:28.769 --> 00:04:30.395
From Sophie?

00:04:32.856 --> 00:04:35.817
"That Which Comes"

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:55.754
"Greetings to the Flame-Haired
Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:04:55.963 --> 00:04:58.006
Or it's Shana now, yes?

00:04:58.215 --> 00:05:01.927
And also to the Specialist of
Everything.

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.762
I'm pleased to learn that you are well.

00:05:03.971 --> 00:05:06.932
You may have already heard,

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:11.979
but the Shanghai Outlaw
headquarters has fallen to the enemy.

00:05:12.187 --> 00:05:14.231
We mourn the loss of
the Annihilator of Bladed Flowers,

00:05:14.439 --> 00:05:17.693
as well as our many other comrades.

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:22.656
But this event has the benefit
of bringing our allies together.

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:27.536
A threat, greater than any
we have ever known, is upon us.

00:05:27.744 --> 00:05:28.996
Additionally,

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:32.958
with regard to your own problem,

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:36.420
it's time that you stop fooling yourself.

00:05:36.628 --> 00:05:41.258
The time has come to unite you with you."

00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:43.760
Me and me?

00:05:43.969 --> 00:05:45.971
What is she talking about?

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:54.521
The way it bends means
you can't handle it, at that size.

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.357
If you form a precise
mental image of a larger you,

00:05:57.566 --> 00:05:58.817
you should be able to manage it.

00:05:59.026 --> 00:06:04.573
Basically you need to
keep using it until you're used to it.

00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:08.910
I don't understand.
What was Sophie talking about?

00:06:09.119 --> 00:06:11.872
What did she mean by fooling myself?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.957
I am me.

00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:16.877
And I wrote all about Yuji...

00:06:17.085 --> 00:06:18.629
Pay attention!

00:06:18.837 --> 00:06:20.464
Once more!

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:30.974
Sir Stolas!

00:06:31.183 --> 00:06:34.394
If it isn't Pirsoyn, the Cup of
Corrupting Indulgence.

00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:37.939
I'd heard you accompanied the
General on his attack.

00:06:38.148 --> 00:06:40.317
So you're back.

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:42.527
Was it related to that other matter?

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:46.948
No, I just ended up going,
by the General's request.

00:06:47.157 --> 00:06:48.241
And yourself?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.745
Naturally, to enjoy the honor of an audience

00:06:51.953 --> 00:06:53.205
with our leader.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:59.378
Come to think of it, isn't Ribesal,
the Dashing Earthly Fiend, with you?

00:06:59.586 --> 00:07:03.423
Yeah... But for now,
you should leave him alone.

00:07:03.632 --> 00:07:05.634
Herald Stolas!

00:07:10.931 --> 00:07:13.975
Greetings, Sir Ribesal.
You are in high spirits today.

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:15.560
Or not, depending...

00:07:15.769 --> 00:07:16.978
What's wrong?

00:07:17.187 --> 00:07:19.231
What else?

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:20.774
You saw it!

00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:25.320
Our leader has returned, but are
we to recognize him as our leader?

00:07:25.529 --> 00:07:28.407
Ridiculous! He's a Mystes!

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:30.909
Regardless of what Treasure he holds,

00:07:31.118 --> 00:07:36.164
he's a devoured human's mere leftovers,
to be dispelled at will by a Denizen!

00:07:36.373 --> 00:07:37.624
Ribesal! You overstep--

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:40.544
We know nothing of him.

00:07:40.752 --> 00:07:45.257
And why do the Strategist
and the Priestess serve him?

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:49.845
What does this leader plan for us?

00:07:50.053 --> 00:07:53.640
Could he be an even greater
manipulator than the Strategist?

00:07:53.849 --> 00:07:57.436
Could he lead us more
effectively than the Priestess?

00:07:57.644 --> 00:08:01.940
Is he a more formidable
warrior than the General?

00:08:02.149 --> 00:08:04.151
Calm yourself.

00:08:04.359 --> 00:08:06.319
Would you like me to use my role as Herald

00:08:06.528 --> 00:08:10.240
to inform the Strategist that
the men have concerns over this?

00:08:10.449 --> 00:08:14.202
She would know the best course.

00:08:15.078 --> 00:08:18.039
That's a great idea, Ribesal. Let's do that.

00:08:18.248 --> 00:08:19.541
Given the situation,

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.753
the Strategist would not wish
discontent among our ranks.

00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:25.213
No, I agree.

00:08:25.422 --> 00:08:27.048
More importantly...

00:08:27.632 --> 00:08:29.593
Wh-What are you doing?

00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:32.304
I have a better idea.

00:08:39.227 --> 00:08:44.441
That it's winter is more
than a little unfortunate.

00:08:44.649 --> 00:08:50.822
If only it were spring,
beautiful flowers would be everywhere.

00:08:51.031 --> 00:08:53.450
Winter holds its own pleasures.

00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:57.204
And now I can speak with you,

00:08:57.412 --> 00:09:00.290
without seeking your voice among the heights.

00:09:00.499 --> 00:09:03.126
That alone...

00:09:03.335 --> 00:09:06.379
Winter holds its own pleasures?

00:09:06.588 --> 00:09:10.091
That is how you've
endured my absence, is it not?

00:09:14.012 --> 00:09:16.890
Winter is deep, but winter fades.

00:09:17.098 --> 00:09:19.893
Spring is distant, but spring comes.

00:09:20.101 --> 00:09:23.438
Is all mere illusion?

00:09:23.647 --> 00:09:27.234
Some prank played, when one is lost?

00:09:28.193 --> 00:09:31.613
We can only know each other's hearts.

00:09:31.822 --> 00:09:35.408
Bel-Peol, that Denizen just now...
Was that the Herald?

00:09:35.617 --> 00:09:39.913
Yes. He brought a message
from Thousand Changes Sydonay.

00:09:40.121 --> 00:09:43.917
The Shanghai Outlaw's
headquarters has fallen.

00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:47.712
Most of the external
groundwork has been laid...

00:09:47.921 --> 00:09:49.506
Excellent.

00:09:49.714 --> 00:09:55.470
Then, in my absence, the skills of
the Thousand Changes have not rusted.

00:09:55.679 --> 00:10:02.227
The Flame Hazes will be unable to
monitor the outside for a long time to come.

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:07.190
I can go to see her without interference.

00:10:07.399 --> 00:10:09.651
Then you will go?

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.278
Of course.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.409
As we head toward our Grand Order,
the sole thing that could stop me

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:19.160
is the God of Atonement,

00:10:19.369 --> 00:10:21.746
the Flame of the Heavens.

00:10:21.955 --> 00:10:23.790
You know this.

00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:30.088
I cannot doubt our leader's words.

00:10:30.297 --> 00:10:31.923
However...

00:10:32.132 --> 00:10:36.678
Why did he choose the Mystes,
and not the Tyrant, as his vessel?

00:10:36.887 --> 00:10:43.059
Why his obsession with the Flame of the
Heavens and the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer?

00:10:43.268 --> 00:10:45.896
Does some part of the boy's own will remain?

00:10:46.104 --> 00:10:48.231
It isn't a question of whether we can do it.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.650
We shall, no matter what.

00:10:50.859 --> 00:10:52.444
That is all.

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:53.987
Yes, Sir.

00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:59.117
I cause you so much trouble,
just as I did long ago.

00:10:59.326 --> 00:11:03.371
Your happiness spoils me,
and in the end, I cause you great pain.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.999
Your words do me honor...

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.586
But I will not fail twice.

00:11:09.794 --> 00:11:12.380
For your sakes, as well.

00:11:12.589 --> 00:11:17.385
This small human's body isn't all bad.

00:11:17.594 --> 00:11:20.722
Like this, I can be with you and touch you.

00:11:20.931 --> 00:11:21.640
Yes.

00:11:21.848 --> 00:11:23.016
Indeed.

00:11:23.224 --> 00:11:30.315
Forgive me for taking you into the outer
world without cause, these past few days.

00:11:30.523 --> 00:11:33.777
I wished to feel it for myself...

00:11:33.985 --> 00:11:38.615
The vast, real world.

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:41.493
This is how I like it.

00:11:43.578 --> 00:11:46.456
The beautiful scenery brings tears,

00:11:46.665 --> 00:11:49.668
and brings hearts together anew.

00:11:49.876 --> 00:11:52.754
This is the world.

00:12:07.018 --> 00:12:10.146
What is it, Fecor?

00:12:10.355 --> 00:12:16.236
Preparations for our master's
ceremonial audience are complete.

00:12:16.444 --> 00:12:19.447
Well done, Tempest Hoof.

00:12:20.907 --> 00:12:22.117
Let us go.

00:12:28.456 --> 00:12:31.418
Don't do it, Ribesal. It isn't our place!

00:12:31.626 --> 00:12:33.044
It's a really bad idea!

00:12:33.253 --> 00:12:34.963
I care not.

00:12:35.171 --> 00:12:39.259
We do not surrender fear or
respect because of someone's rank.

00:12:39.467 --> 00:12:44.264
Only because of their power.
That is how we make decisions.

00:12:45.432 --> 00:12:46.850
Look.

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:52.063
Over there, too.

00:12:52.272 --> 00:12:55.066
To let someone so questionable
into the Palace of the Stars,

00:12:55.275 --> 00:12:58.194
and to allow them free reign...

00:12:58.403 --> 00:13:00.071
This has never happened.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.158
But even so, you cannot
challenge our leader.

00:13:03.366 --> 00:13:05.827
That's what I meant by
not respecting your place!

00:13:06.995 --> 00:13:11.583
Either way, now that you
know my plan, I cannot let you go.

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:13.501
You will remain here.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.379
That's crazy! I don't want to!

00:13:16.588 --> 00:13:18.840
Let me go, Ribesal!

00:13:45.617 --> 00:13:47.243
Name yourself!

00:13:48.453 --> 00:13:51.039
See? The leader knows everything.

00:13:51.247 --> 00:13:54.751
Wanderer Ribesal,
the Dashing Earthly Fiend.

00:13:56.002 --> 00:14:00.715
You will prove to me if you
possess the power to be our master!

00:14:25.615 --> 00:14:26.950
Splendid...

00:14:27.158 --> 00:14:29.619
You've grown up splendidly.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:33.289
The battle's glory is yours,

00:14:33.498 --> 00:14:36.501
Dashing Earthly Fiend Ribesal.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:09.117
Now stand, Denizens of the Crimson World!

00:15:11.619 --> 00:15:16.040
We shall now deliver orders
to the members of Ball Masque.

00:15:19.002 --> 00:15:22.088
Here I am!

00:15:22.297 --> 00:15:26.176
It's finally time for
everyone's favorite thing, orders!

00:15:26.384 --> 00:15:32.807
It's the beginning of an
excellent and exciting experiment!

00:15:33.016 --> 00:15:37.395
This experiment is the result
of years and years of research,

00:15:37.604 --> 00:15:44.569
offering to forever change the Denizens
of the Crimson World's position!

00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:47.780
Professor! Everyone's waiting!

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:57.415
Then explain.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.006
Are you listening
to my explanation, brat?

00:16:05.215 --> 00:16:08.676
It's like you don't even care.
This isn't like you, girlie.

00:16:14.766 --> 00:16:16.935
That's all for now.

00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:20.396
If you aren't interested
in this, there's no point.

00:16:20.605 --> 00:16:22.565
I am interested.

00:16:22.774 --> 00:16:26.736
But you're just swinging
a flame arm around.

00:16:28.112 --> 00:16:30.323
Why not bestow a name upon it,

00:16:30.531 --> 00:16:33.201
to aid your internalization of it, indeed?

00:16:33.409 --> 00:16:34.911
Attachment is certain.

00:16:35.119 --> 00:16:37.997
Not a bad idea, but

00:16:38.206 --> 00:16:42.126
the user should decide the name.

00:16:42.335 --> 00:16:43.503
A name...

00:16:43.711 --> 00:16:45.588
It's hard to think
of something on the spot.

00:16:45.797 --> 00:16:47.882
Here is a good example for you.

00:16:48.091 --> 00:16:53.054
The previous Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed
Slayer dubbed her power Knights.

00:16:53.263 --> 00:16:55.848
To her, the embodiment of power

00:16:56.057 --> 00:17:00.270
was an army of knights,
plunging themselves into battle.

00:17:00.478 --> 00:17:05.608
But as you train,
what you're discovering

00:17:05.817 --> 00:17:07.151
is probably...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.195
...your own self.

00:17:09.737 --> 00:17:12.532
The period of deceiving
yourself is now over.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:16.703
The time has come
to unite you and you.

00:17:17.704 --> 00:17:19.539
Me, myself...

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:31.384
Amazing.

00:17:31.592 --> 00:17:34.345
Looks like she's got it!

00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:37.682
We won't know till
she gives it another try!

00:17:38.641 --> 00:17:40.935
Here we go, brat!

00:17:49.527 --> 00:17:52.697
It's been a long time, Decarabia.

00:17:52.905 --> 00:17:58.328
There's no emergency happening now,
so I didn't expect to see you.

00:17:58.536 --> 00:18:01.914
They've finally ordered me to go, too.

00:18:09.339 --> 00:18:14.635
You're on an errand for me,
so do everything I tell you.

00:18:14.844 --> 00:18:15.595
Yes.

00:18:15.803 --> 00:18:19.223
The length of the
journey isn't what matters.

00:18:19.432 --> 00:18:21.100
That's up to you.

00:18:21.309 --> 00:18:22.727
Goodbye.

00:18:23.394 --> 00:18:24.812
Here.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:28.775
The most important part
of working at an Outlaw post

00:18:28.983 --> 00:18:31.569
is to avoid Denizens
of the Crimson World,

00:18:31.778 --> 00:18:35.573
when Flame Hazes aren't around.

00:18:35.782 --> 00:18:38.368
This is something given for those times.

00:18:38.576 --> 00:18:41.954
Essentially, it's a Denizen detector!

00:18:42.163 --> 00:18:46.125
We added some extra toys for you, though!

00:18:47.335 --> 00:18:50.880
Basically, if you sense a Denizen with this,

00:18:51.089 --> 00:18:54.967
do whatever you must to get the hell out.

00:18:55.176 --> 00:18:57.470
Don't try to get close
or investigate without orders.

00:18:57.678 --> 00:19:01.349
I'm sure you know, but if
you have any notion of fighting it,

00:19:01.557 --> 00:19:03.643
I would never forgive you.

00:19:04.811 --> 00:19:05.603
Yes.

00:19:05.812 --> 00:19:07.647
I'll be back.

00:19:12.902 --> 00:19:14.529
I know that.

00:19:15.071 --> 00:19:20.660
She's right. Without Margery-san,
without a Flame Haze,

00:19:20.868 --> 00:19:22.495
I could never...

00:19:23.621 --> 00:19:25.873
--Hey, did you see that thing in front of the station?

00:19:25.873 --> 00:19:28.418
--This is the real world.
--Hey, did you see that thing in front of the station?

00:19:28.626 --> 00:19:31.170
Right now, someone
is being devoured.

00:19:31.379 --> 00:19:34.715
But no one will notice.

00:19:34.924 --> 00:19:37.635
They'll never remember they existed...

00:19:37.844 --> 00:19:40.972
Or realize they could be next.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.308
But for Margery-san, I...

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:48.312
What?

00:19:48.521 --> 00:19:50.064
What is this feeling?

00:19:50.273 --> 00:19:52.358
Somethings approaching, really fast!

00:19:53.943 --> 00:19:55.319
A Denizen?

00:19:55.528 --> 00:19:57.780
No way! But why?

00:19:57.989 --> 00:20:01.242
It can't be... They know I'm here?

00:20:01.451 --> 00:20:02.952
Is it that way?

00:20:03.161 --> 00:20:05.455
What should I do?

00:20:06.205 --> 00:20:10.626
If you sense a Denizen with this,
do whatever you must to get the hell out.

00:20:10.835 --> 00:20:12.837
That's right... Run!

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:14.881
But how...

00:20:28.978 --> 00:20:30.354
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:30.563 --> 00:20:31.731
Release me!

00:20:31.939 --> 00:20:32.648
Let me go!

00:20:32.857 --> 00:20:33.816
Sum it!

00:20:34.025 --> 00:20:34.817
Sum it!

00:20:35.026 --> 00:20:36.903
Oh, no! Am I going to die?

00:20:37.111 --> 00:20:39.530
Will everything end,
before it's even started?

00:20:39.739 --> 00:20:41.574
Margery-san!

00:20:52.877 --> 00:20:56.172
Just now... The Denizen wasn't on my train,

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.382
but on the passing one.

00:20:59.342 --> 00:21:02.553
I'm safe. They didn't know I'm here.

00:21:02.762 --> 00:21:04.931
Man, this is nuts.

00:21:06.349 --> 00:21:08.976
Wait... Wait!

00:21:09.185 --> 00:21:11.479
If it was on the other train...

00:21:11.479 --> 00:21:16.275
<i>I must be dreaming tonight.</i>

00:21:16.275 --> 00:21:17.568
Another request for
immediate reinforcements.

00:21:17.568 --> 00:21:21.822
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:22.031 --> 00:21:23.533
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:23.533 --> 00:21:27.286
From all evidence,
it's possible that this city is...

00:21:27.286 --> 00:21:29.038
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:29.038 --> 00:21:29.330
...A Maelstrom of Conflict.

00:21:30.331 --> 00:21:35.419
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:21:35.419 --> 00:21:37.672
No, it's nothing.

00:21:37.672 --> 00:21:41.050
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:21:41.259 --> 00:21:43.261
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:21:43.469 --> 00:21:48.849
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:50.977 --> 00:21:55.022
<i>“I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:58.067 --> 00:22:01.028
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:01.237 --> 00:22:04.615
<i>ls also inside of me
(I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.824 --> 00:22:07.785
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.994 --> 00:22:13.749
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.958 --> 00:22:15.042
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.251 --> 00:22:18.337
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.546 --> 00:22:21.674
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.882 --> 00:22:25.094
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.303 --> 00:22:28.472
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:31.809
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:32.018 --> 00:22:35.187
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.396 --> 00:22:39.108
<i>But I don't want to overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.317 --> 00:22:42.028
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.236 --> 00:22:50.286
<i>The vanishing afterimage, that is you
in and of itself (So now that you & I)</i>

00:22:50.494 --> 00:22:51.537
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.746 --> 00:22:53.497
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.706 --> 00:22:57.126
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.335 --> 00:23:00.463
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.671 --> 00:23:03.883
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.091 --> 00:23:06.927
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:07.136 --> 00:23:10.681
<i>ls also inside of me
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.809
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:14.018 --> 00:23:22.526
<i>“I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:26.072 --> 00:23:27.907
Yuji returns to Misaki City.

00:23:28.115 --> 00:23:32.453
Memories of the days he spent
and those he knew return to him.

00:23:32.662 --> 00:23:35.915
But he had another reason to come.

00:23:36.123 --> 00:23:38.376
Next time, on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.584 --> 00:23:39.919
"To Embark Upon a Journey."
